85 条，列为\n  `code, grade, domain, cluster, requirement, pdf_page`。\n\n年级取值：K, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, High School — Number and Quantity, High School — Algebra, High School — Functions, High School — Geometry, High School — Statistics and Probability。\n\n## 怎么查\n\n编号已知时直接按编号取行（编号在第一列，行首匹配最准）：\n\n```bash\ngrep -m1 '^8.G.7,' references/standards.csv\n```\n\n按年级或领域筛选，只看编号和要求两列：\n\n```bash\nawk -F',' '$2==\"5\"' references/standards.csv | cut -d',' -f1,5\ngrep ',Geometry,' references/standards.csv | cut -d',' -f1,5\n```\n\n按关键词找（例如勾股定理相关）：\n\n```bash\ngrep -i 'pythagorean' references/standards.csv | cut -d',' -f1,2,5\n```\n\n`requirement` 字段里含逗号，所以取整行文本时用 `grep` 原样输出，别用 `cut` 切到第 5 列以后。\n\n## 回答约定\n\n- 引用课标要求时给出**原文**（英文）加编号，必要时再翻译。\n- 一并给出 `grade` / `domain` 和 `pdf_page`，方便回到 PDF 核对。\n- 表里没有的条目直说没有，不要照编号规律臆造。\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1788754346671},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me query the standards for Grade 4 NBT domain. First let me look at the reference files.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_eda765c66652491388beb951","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"ls /Users/l/other_git_repos/calculus-quest/nodejs_react_lib/learn-claude-code/custom_skill_space/math-standards/references/"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"ark-plan","model":"glm-5.3","usage":{"input":759,"output":66,"cacheRead":2240,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":3065,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0},"cacheWrite1h":0},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788754346672,"responseId":"021788754346733fd0de7354b348b065f00b895e07126b88a4aa8","rawStopReason":"tool_use"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_eda765c66652491388beb951","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"index.md\nstandards.csv\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1788754348239},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_6939ccb1d08c46c8aaa0d63e","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"awk -F',' '$2==\"4\" && $3==\"Numbe